codex
The audit exposed one worthwhile strengthening: the passing claim began after `maximum` was already bound. I’m tightening Gate A by extending the claim backward through `#loadAll(Module(FuncDef(...)))`, so the proof itself connects the generated function definition, name binding, exact body, call, return, heap allocations, and result.
